  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Budget and Financial Accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist in the establishment of a national treasury. Technical assistance includes: strengthening and developing treasury functions, which are currently fragmented or nonexistent; provide assistance with the establishment of a Treasury Unit to manage cash and treasury functions centrally; developing and implementing strategies and long-range plans to improve cash management practices, which will support effective budget execution; establishing and initiating the operations of a Treasury Single Account to support improved cash management; drafting policies and establishing the legal framework for investment of funds not needed for immediate expenditures; and liaising with Integrated Financial Management Information System (IFMIS) project team to ensure configuration which supports cash forecasting and treasury functions, and establish efficient payment and collection systems.</narrative>
  </description>
